  "review": [
    "Strict numeric and pseudonym command allowlists; no arbitrary evaluation or credential export.",
    "Separate localhost-only bridge leaves installed read-only extensions untouched.",
    "Durable intent before write; OS lock; page duplicate guards; post-write independent reads; no mutation retries.",
    "Source and fixtures are not live proof. Native isPlayer and cache freshness remain subject to live preflight and readback.",
    "V2: native tradable boolean mapped through current official Item factory contract; legacy polling cannot attest v2 attachment. Broad first-page row seeds one exact version search, from which an auction with sufficient remaining lifetime is selected. No writes preceded the update.",
    "V3: official repositories.Item.setDirty expires purchased/transfer cache before independent native reads; no account/server mutation. Existing buy intent and response are preserved. Only unwritten move/list stages can resume after fresh physical item and exact original coin delta are proven; missing response or other prior write intents remain read-only.",
    "Final current implementation: cold-cache reconciliation preserves cached failed reads, resumes only unsubmitted move/list stages, checks positive pseudonymized live IDs, and records exact acquisition/listing observations. Native transaction proof resides in live.json and its independently derived verification, never in this source review."
  ],
